      "target": "cheshire_system",
      "kind": "related",
      "rationale": "Candidate; unproven. Core requirements Scope of the IP / Cache requirements / Interface requirements relate to system CVA6 Cores. Generic CVA6 requirements include multiple configurations, while Initial Release names CV32 variants; applicability must be selected explicitly for Cheshire CV64."
    },
    {
      "id": "ch-009",
      "source": "cva6_mmu",
      "target": "cva6_requirements",
      "kind": "refines",
      "rationale": "Candidate; unproven. Memory Management Unit / Page Table Walker details core Privileges and virtual memory. Sv32, Sv39 and optional virtualization configuration differences must remain explicit."
    },
