      "source": "cva6_execute",
      "target": "cva6_requirements",
      "kind": "refines",
      "rationale": "Candidate; unproven. Execute Stage Load Store Unit (LSU) / Store Buffer / PMA/PMP Checks details core memory and cache requirements. Memory visibility and exceptions need configuration-specific checks."
    },
    {
      "id": "ch-011",
      "source": "cva6_mmu",
      "target": "cva6_execute",
      "kind": "related",
      "rationale": "Candidate; unproven. MMU Page Table Walker / Translation Lookaside Buffer relates to Execute Stage Memory Management Unit (MMU) / PMA/PMP Checks. Translation faults, retries and load/store completion must agree."
    },
    {
      "id": "ch-012",
      "source": "cva6_fetch",
      "target": "cva6_pcgen",
      "kind": "related",
      "rationale": "Candidate; unproven. Instruction Fetch Stage Fetch FIFO and PC Generation Branch Prediction define adjacent pipeline boundaries. Redirects and outstanding fetch responses require flush-aware checking."
    },
    {
      "id": "ch-013",
      "source": "cva6_decode",
      "target": "cva6_issue",
      "kind": "related",
      "rationale": "Candidate; unproven. Instruction Decode Instruction Re-aligner / Compressed Decoder relates to Issue Stage Issue / Scoreboard. Instruction boundaries, exceptions and scoreboard entries require correspondence."
    },
