      "target": "cva6_execute",
      "kind": "related",
      "rationale": "Candidate; unproven. Issue Stage Scoreboard / Read Operands feeds execution units described by Execute Stage. Dependency hazards, result writeback and exception propagation are candidate checks."
    },
