      "source": "cva6_commit",
      "target": "cva6_execute",
      "kind": "related",
      "rationale": "Candidate; unproven. Commit Stage defines retirement sequencing around Execute Stage Store Buffer / CSR Buffer. Stores and exceptions must obey architectural commit ordering."
    },
