      "kind": "related",
      "rationale": "Candidate; unproven. Boot ROM _start polls BIST_STATUS_DONE before writing CFG_SPM_LOW/HIGH and CFG_COMMIT. This is a candidate implementation of LLC BIST Initialization Sequence / Configuration and Flush: BIST initializes ways as cache, then software changes them to SPM."
    },
